[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727517366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104171#issuecomment-2727517366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104171","id":2727517366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikpy2","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T16:03:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T16:03:08Z","body":"Just to make it clear, this PR is ready for review.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727517366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727778178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104171#issuecomment-2727778178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104171","id":2727778178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ilpeC","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T01:00:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T01:22:17Z","body":"Test project: [test_input_virtual.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19276685/test_input_virtual.zip)\r\n\r\nThe tests on 2 devices were ok.  _(Google Pixel smartphone and Samsung tablet)_ \r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nCan `LineEdit` from SpinBox also be displayed in the Inspector?\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Details</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n%SpinBox.get_line_edit().virtual_keyboard_enabled\r\n%SpinBox.get_line_edit().virtual_keyboard_type\r\n```\r\n\r\n![Bildschirmfoto 2025-03-17 um 01 45 10](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a07ede37-fbf8-4f1d-b649-955b9e15cf7b)\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\n\r\nMaybe like `editable`.\r\n\r\n_(a clean solution would probably be inheritance, C++ allows multiple inheritance, but only one class can be passed to `GDCLASS`, I think)_\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nclass SpinBox : public Range {\r\n\tGDCLASS(SpinBox, Range);\r\n\r\n\tLineEdit *line_edit = nullptr;\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nvoid SpinBox::set_editable(bool p_enabled) {\r\n\tline_edit->set_editable(p_enabled);\r\n\tqueue_redraw();\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c3ba82d-b9f3-4821-a024-e7a66537abab)\r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727778178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728134965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104171#issuecomment-2728134965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104171","id":2728134965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6inAk1","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T04:48:37Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T04:49:02Z","body":"> Test project: [test_input_virtual.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19276685/test_input_virtual.zip)\n> \n> The tests on 2 devices were ok.  _(Google Pixel smartphone and Samsung tablet)_ \n> \n> ----------------\n> \n> Can `LineEdit` from SpinBox also be displayed in the Inspector?\n> \n> <details><summary>Details</summary>\n> \n> ```gdscript\n> %SpinBox.get_line_edit().virtual_keyboard_enabled\n> %SpinBox.get_line_edit().virtual_keyboard_type\n> ```\n> \n> ![Bildschirmfoto 2025-03-17 um 01 45 10](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a07ede37-fbf8-4f1d-b649-955b9e15cf7b)\n> \n> ----------------\n> \n> \n> Maybe like `editable`.\n> \n> _(a clean solution would probably be inheritance, C++ allows multiple inheritance, but only one class can be passed to `GDCLASS`, I think)_\n> \n> ```cpp\n> class SpinBox : public Range {\n> \tGDCLASS(SpinBox, Range);\n> \n> \tLineEdit *line_edit = nullptr;\n> \n> ---------\n> \n> void SpinBox::set_editable(bool p_enabled) {\n> \tline_edit->set_editable(p_enabled);\n> \tqueue_redraw();\n> }\n> \n> \n> ```\n> \n> ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c3ba82d-b9f3-4821-a024-e7a66537abab)\n> \n> </details>\n\nWe can do something like `editable`. I just didn't exposed it to inspector as there is no need to change the keyboard type to anything other than `number` for SpinBox.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728134965/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729250040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104171#issuecomment-2729250040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104171","id":2729250040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6irQz4","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T12:08:31Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T12:08:31Z","body":"I encountered an issue where, the keyboard type for `TextEdit` switches to `multiline` keyboard after submitting/pressing enter, instead of retaining the specified keyboard type. I'm marking this as a draft until I resolve the issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729250040/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]